{"duration_api_ms":789366,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"8642f113-ebe7-4ea9-b822-3566d565fd98","total_cost_usd":6.000140999999999,"usage":{"input_tokens":128,"cache_creation_input_tokens":109549,"cache_read_input_tokens":6476720,"output_tokens":36777,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":8309},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":106190,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1486,"cache_read_input_tokens":137237,"cache_creation_input_tokens":337,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":337},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":128,"outputTokens":36777,"cacheReadInputTokens":6476720,"cacheCreationInputTokens":109549,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":2.897711,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":8309,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":106190,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-fable-5-1":{"inputTokens":196388,"outputTokens":22771,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":3.10243,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"thinkingTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-fable-5-1","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":63,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"The code change works and both acceptance commands pass, but the packet's measurable goal is not met: LoadDoc does not drop by more than the run spread.\n\n**What changed** (`external/web-apps` commit 9b58c858, `controller/Toolbar.js` only):\n- Draw, Header & Footer and View are now added as tab headers with an empty panel. The tab list, captions and visibility are unchanged.\n- Each panel is built once, by whichever comes first:\n  - the first time the tab is opened, or a call to `buildDeferredTab(action)` (for plugins/API);\n  - a 0 ms timer after `asc_LoadDocument` is issued (in practice this always wins);\n  - the start of `Toolbar.onAppReady`, as a backstop.\n- Locks already set on the toolbar (`disableOnStart`, `lostConnect`, …) are copied onto the late-built buttons.\n- Forms, Review, Protect and Links are still built at startup. So is View when it is the viewer's opening tab.\n\n**Decisions:**\n- **Not built on first click.** HeaderFooterTab puts buttons into the Insert tab, ViewTab puts zoom buttons into other toolbar slots, and both tab views assume their panel exists by `app:ready`. Waiting for a click would empty part of Insert and crash at `app:ready`. Fixing that needs files outside the target, so \"after `asc_LoadDocument`, before `app:ready`\" is as late as this packet can go.\n- **The backstop in `Toolbar.onAppReady` is safe** because that handler is registered at launch, before the tab views register theirs. One risk remains, written in the log: if `app:ready` ever came before the 0 ms timer, the late views would miss their own `app:ready` handler. I never saw it happen; it would need the document to finish loading first.\n\n**Results** (15 runs per side, in `baseline.md`):\n| | before | after |\n|---|---:|---:|\n| CPU of these three tabs before LoadDoc | ≈30–40 ms | ≈1 ms |\n| large-100p LoadDoc (median) | 1 264 ms | 1 191 ms (inside a ≈300–600 ms spread) |\n| medium-10p LoadDoc (median) | 1 222 ms | 1 224 ms |\n\n- **Medium-10p early result was wrong.** The first medium runs showed a 0.8–1.2 s drop. Running the sides in reverse order made it disappear, so it came from run order, not from the change. The table uses the reversed-order runs.\n- **Where the time really goes.** Most of the Toolbar's ≈200–250 ms before LoadDoc is the toolbar view drawing all its own panels (Insert, Layout, References), not these tab controllers. I recorded a follow-up request for that in `.theseus/spawn/`, needing `documentserver` and `browser`.\n\n**Checks:**\n- `documenteditor-open.sh` passes, but it opens the installed bundle, not this change.\n- `differential/web-apps-documenteditor.sh` passes 4/4. One earlier run showed two co-editing differences while a timing run was going at the same time; it passed when run alone.\n- The differential only compares the visible Home tab. So I ran a separate browser check with each build swapped in: opening draw, headerfooter, view and ins after load. It gave the same tabs, panels and button counts on both builds, no empty panels left over, the Header & Footer buttons still in Insert, and no console errors. That script stays in the session folder and is not committed.\n- I added no unit test under `tests/unit`.\n- `theseus scope-check` is clean. `theseus validate` shows 0 errors and 3 warnings that I did not look into.\n- Executor log, baseline table, follow-up request and friction line are committed on the branch.\n\n**Lessons for the Atlas:**\n- Editor tabs depend on each other: some inject buttons into other tabs, and their views expect their panel to exist by `app:ready`.\n- The Toolbar's cost before LoadDoc is mostly the toolbar view drawing its own panels.\n- On this VM, LoadDoc drifts by up to ≈1 s with run order. Compare sides back to back with 15 runs and nothing else running.\n- `perf/open-window.js` only measures the installed bundle, so comparing builds means swapping files under `/var/www` by hand (noted in my friction line).","ttft_ms":5279,"type":"result","duration_ms":2836257,"uuid":"1ee4cbea-696d-4b61-af72-6480cd7ef8f3","ttft_stream_ms":4120,"time_to_request_ms":331,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":7,"system_prompt":218,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":3,"input_attachments":18,"input_hooks":3,"conversation_append":0,"transcript_persist":7,"tool_pool_refresh":0,"init_message":6,"init_frame_send":3,"engine_pickup":2,"loop_entry":4,"message_prep":0,"model_config_wait":1,"autocompact":2,"request_announcements":12,"query_setup":5,"auto_mode_context_wait":7,"model_gates":0,"tool_schema_build":22,"message_normalization":3,"client_creation":2,"request_build":6},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":126,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":137,"time_to_request_major_faults":26,"process_rss_mib_turn_start":211,"process_anon_mib_turn_start":140,"process_rss_mib_result":259,"process_anon_mib_result":165,"process_peak_rss_mib":287,"process_cpu_ms_turn":23444,"process_wall_ms_turn":2836256,"process_cpu_ms_streaming":6287,"process_wall_ms_streaming":653149,"main_stream_count":62,"main_stream_event_count":4795,"main_stream_chunk_count":3495,"process_turn_states":{"main_stream":{"cpu_ms":6287,"wall_ms":653149,"entries":62},"tool":{"cpu_ms":13076,"wall_ms":2044536,"entries":61},"first_event_wait":{"cpu_ms":2132,"wall_ms":135514,"entries":62},"before_first_request":{"cpu_ms":137,"wall_ms":331,"entries":1},"between_requests":{"cpu_ms":1795,"wall_ms":2710,"entries":61},"after_last_request":{"cpu_ms":17,"wall_ms":16,"entries":1}},"input_attachments_detail":{"slowest_producer":"artifact_opening_prefetch","slowest_producer_ms":7,"cpu_ms":18,"major_faults":0,"setup_ms":0,"prompt_producers_ms":0,"ambient_start_ms":8,"ambient_wait_ms":7,"render_ms":1,"producers":41,"token_counts":0},"tool_schema_build_detail":{"betas_ms":0,"waits_ms":1,"placement_ms":1,"render_ms":20,"after_ms":0,"other_ms":0,"tools":21,"new_schemas":21},"messa